    <string name="setup_enable_title">1. Turn on Akkhara Keyboard</string>
    <string name="setup_enable_body">Switch it on in Android\'s list of keyboards. Android will show its usual warning for any new keyboard; Akkhara stores nothing you type, and uses the internet only to download translation models.</string>
